{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SvFrLTizeqxvdEVGmjE1TC","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"cloudflare agents createMcpHandler @modelcontextprotocol/server v2 McpServer\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"createMcpHandler MCP Server\",\"url\":\"https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/lp0f32ea4a\"},{\"title\":\"# Creating MCP Servers\",\"url\":\"https://unpkg.com/agents@0.20.1/docs/mcp-servers.md\"},{\"title\":\"MCP Worker Server\",\"url\":\"https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/mfpr64tc62\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/model-context-protocol/protocol/transport/\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/model-context-protocol/transport\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/model-context-protocol/protocol/transport/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/model-context-protocol/apis/handler-api/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"ec570ea1.previews.developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://ec570ea1.previews.developers.cloudflare.com/agents/model-context-protocol/apis/handler-api/index.md\"},{\"title\":\"6e8c1c3a.previews.developers.cloudflare.com\",\"url\":\"https://6e8c1c3a.previews.developers.cloudflare.com/agents/model-context-protocol/apis/handler-api/index.md\"}]\n\nThe search turned up a clear split between the SDK v2 path and the older v1 examples.\n\n- **v2 setup:** The newer docs have the handler take a server factory rather than a server instance. One preview page says `createMcpHandler` creates a callable stateless MCP request handler from an MCP SDK v2 server factory. The matching install is `npm i agents @modelcontextprotocol/server@2.0.0 zod`, and the import comes from the isolated server entry point, `agents/mcp/server`.\n- **Legacy path:** The table on the same page maps `createLegacyMcpHandler` to `agents/mcp` with `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, for legacy sessions through WorkerTransport.\n- **Deprecation:** `McpAgent` is deprecated and feature-frozen. The Agents docs say new servers should use `createMcpHandler()`.\n- **Statelessness:** One caution from the docs: if your stateless MCP server declares `McpServer` or transport instances in the global scope, you must create new instances per request.\n\nThe sources conflict. The main Cloudflare transport page and several third-party listings (Glama) still show `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/mcp.js` with `agents/mcp` and `createMcpHandler(server)`. These look like the v1-era pattern, so check which Agents version you have installed before copying them.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b7b43b60-fa71-419f-a566-2aabaae72611","uuid":"2b86e46e-cd86-44c5-b9b8-795128854012","timestamp":"2026-10-11T03:15:21.185Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"cloudflare agents createMcpHandler @modelcontextprotocol/server v2 McpServer","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_0156GVNdaQyKAx6kbv3oiA8i","content":[{"title":"createMcpHandler MCP Server","url":"https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/lp0f32ea4a"},{"title":"# Creating MCP Servers","url":"https://unpkg.com/agents@0.20.1/docs/mcp-servers.md"},{"title":"MCP Worker Server","url":"https://glama.ai/mcp/servers/mfpr64tc62"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/model-context-protocol/protocol/transport/"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/model-context-protocol/transport"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/model-context-protocol/protocol/transport/index.md"},{"title":"developers.cloudflare.com","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/agents/model-context-protocol/apis/handler-api/index.md"},{"title":"ec570ea1.previews.devel